Z||000011||MinnGreenGT||08-24-2001||05:40 PM||||FieroShop... just curious.  How does your scoop differ from the JL extractor vent?<BR><A HREF="http://www.fortunecity.com/silverstone/impala/403/extractorinstall.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fortunecity.com/silverstone/impala/403/extractorinstall.htm</A><BR>Is it the angle in the vents as opposed to the straight front edge? Also yours appears flush with the hood- no raised leading edge...right? I'm not trying to say one is better or worse than the other, just checking the differences.  I'm planning on buying one shortly. Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
